{"created": "2026-09-03T12:12:28.238449+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-03T12:12:29.686221+00:00", "id": 22234059, "conceptrecid": "22234058", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22234059", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22234058", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22234059", "metadata": {"title": "MODAVIS Pipe Organ Dataset (POD) 1.5.0 \u2014 Public Core, Reproducibility Databases, URI Ledger, and Documentation", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22234059", "publication_date": "2026-09-01", "description": "<p>The MODAVIS Pipe Organ Dataset (POD) combines records from 25 source collections for research on pipe organs, their builders, technical specifications, documented histories, locations, and virtual representations.</p>\n<p>Release 1.5.0 contains <strong>215,769 canonical organ records</strong>, <strong>11,778 canonical builders</strong>, 333,519 builder assertions, 503,980 structured specification components, 115,814 technical facts, 454,789 documented event assertions, 897 virtual instruments, and 34,038 corrected musiXplora relations. Disagreements between technical sources are retained with their citations. Events report documented history and do not state an organ's present condition.</p>\n<p>The record provides SQLite databases for general use, OrgMap, and OrgRec; a persistent identifier ledger; native MODAVIS, CIDOC CRM 7.1.3, Polifonia Organs 1.0, and Europeana Data Model JSON-LD exports; checksums; provenance; a dataset card; citation metadata; and release documentation. The Europeana Data Model export is a mapping preview rather than an ingestion package.</p>\n<p>A PostgreSQL 15 custom-format dump reproduces the public dataset in MODAVIS Navigator. It contains only the publication-safe schema and is accompanied by a database manifest, restore instructions, a select-only runtime profile, verification results, and the exact public-profile source overlay. The dump was restored into an empty PostgreSQL 15 instance and tested through representative Navigator routes before deposition.</p>\n<p>The open files contain structured facts, identifiers, source citations, and links between related records. They do not contain copies of source databases, descriptive source prose, or binary media. A separate restricted record preserves the complete research package for authorized review.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Ukolov, Dominik", "affiliation": "Digital Humanities (Image/Object), Friedrich Schiller University Jena; Research Group DIGITAL ORGANOLOGY, Leipzig University", "orcid": "0000-0002-7904-3892"}], "keywords": ["MODAVIS", "pipe organ", "organology", "digital organology", "cultural heritage data", "entity reconciliation", "record linkage", "knowledge graph", "linked open data", "SQLite", "PostgreSQL", "Navigator reproducibility", "reproducible research", "CIDOC CRM", "Polifonia Ontology Network", "Europeana Data Model", "persistent identifiers", "virtual musical instruments", "musiXplora", "geospatial humanities", "FAIR data"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22234061", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}], "dates": [{"type": "created", "description": "Release 1.5 files assembled and verified."}], "version": "1.5.0", "references": ["CIDOC CRM official versions registry: https://cidoc-crm.org/versions-of-the-cidoc-crm", "Polifonia Ontology Network, Organs ontology 1.0: https://w3id.org/polifonia/ontology/organs/1.0/", "Europeana Data Model documentation: https://pro.europeana.eu/page/edm-documentation", "W3C Data on the Web Best Practices: https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "modavis"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22234058"}}]}, "notes": "The Europeana Data Model export is a mapping preview. Coordinate accuracy and precision vary by source. Source prose, media, authentication data, and private research state are not included.", "method": "Records were reconciled using identifiers, names, locations, dates, builders, and source-specific evidence. A merge was retained only when the evidence supported a shared identity; uncertain records remain separate. Builder names are linked to canonical person or organization records. Specifications and events were converted to structured fields, while conflicting technical facts remain as separate source-attributed statements. Coordinates retain their recorded source and precision. The release files were generated from the read-only PostgreSQL 15 release database and checked with database integrity tests and SHA-256 manifests. The public PostgreSQL projection was restored into a clean PostgreSQL 15 instance, compared with its source-table parity record, and exercised through a select-only Navigator profile."}, "title": "MODAVIS Pipe Organ Dataset (POD) 1.5.0 \u2014 Public Core, Reproducibility Databases, URI Ledger, and Documentation", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22234059", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22234059", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22234059?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22234059", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22234059", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22234059", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22234059/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22234058", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22234058", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22234058", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22234058", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22234059/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22234059/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22234059/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22234059/media-files", "archive": "https